"""Unit-specific physics and verification extensions, avoiding duplicate failure paragraphs."""
E={}
def add(cid,rows):
 vals=[tuple(x.strip().split(' || '))for x in rows.strip().splitlines()]
 assert len(vals)==10,(cid,len(vals));E[cid]=vals
add('b281',r'''
空氣可壓縮性與液滴破裂對縮尺的反應不同，須分開選擇可外推的觀察量。~Air compressibility and droplet breakup respond differently to scaling, requiring separate decisions about which observations can be extrapolated. || 另列模型最小水深與最大流速。~Also tabulate minimum model depth and maximum flow speed.
若沿堤方向越波不均，單一收集段也不能代表整條堤線的流量分布。~Spatially uneven overtopping means one collector segment cannot represent the discharge distribution along the entire seawall. || 再由單寬量反算收集段總量。~Reconstruct total collected-section flow from the unit-width result.
計量解析度在低越波情境尤其重要，小讀值可能與容器零點漂移相當。~Meter resolution becomes especially important at low overtopping, where the collected increment may resemble tank zero drift. || 用空白試驗量化容器零點漂移。~Quantify collector zero drift through a blank test.
譜矩是波面變異的積分描述，頻率單位與積分間距必須在程式中一致。~The moment integrates surface-elevation variance, requiring consistent frequency units and integration spacing throughout the processing code. || 獨立檢查頻率積分與波面變異數。~Independently compare spectral integration with surface-elevation variance.
有效出水高的分母應使用結構前指定位置的入射波，而非任意遠端設定值。~Relative freeboard should use incident waves at the specified structure location rather than an arbitrary distant generator setting. || 列出水位修正前後的前灘水深。~List foreshore depths before and after each level correction.
能量比例的平方關係還假設入射和反射有相同的傳播介質與群速。~Squaring amplitudes for energy additionally assumes matched propagation medium and group velocity for incident and reflected components. || 對分離後波列重建原始量測訊號。~Reconstruct measured signals from the separated wave components.
感測器的固有頻率和裝置共振同樣限制有效頻帶，不能僅查擷取器規格。~Sensor natural frequency and rig resonance also limit useful bandwidth, so acquisition specifications alone are insufficient evidence. || 比較不同取樣率所得峰值收斂性。~Compare peak convergence at several justified sampling rates.
水舌前緣可能近似乾濕交界，局部水深接近零時此比值會很敏感。~The tongue front approaches a wet-dry boundary, making the ratio highly sensitive when local depth approaches zero. || 記錄深度感測器失效與含氣片段。~Flag depth-sensor dropout and strongly aerated intervals explicitly.
獨立性涉及實際波列而非檔案數量，系統校準偏差也不會隨重複次數消失。~Independence concerns the physical realization rather than file count, and shared calibration bias does not vanish through repetition. || 分開列出隨機變異與共同校準誤差。~Separate random variability from shared calibration uncertainty explicitly.
峰值持續時間決定荷載衝量，結構反應也受自身頻率與阻尼控制。~Peak duration controls load impulse, while the structural response additionally depends on its natural frequencies and damping. || 另外積分時間歷程取得荷載衝量。~Integrate the force history separately to obtain impulse.
''')
add('b282',r'''
體積量測應明確說明是否包含可進水開口孔隙，否則排水體積與材料密度不相容。~Volume measurement must state whether water-accessible pores are included; otherwise displaced volume and the selected material density are inconsistent. || 分別核對實體、外包與堆積體積定義。~Check solid, envelope and stockpile volume definitions separately.
堤頭的三維流況也不同於直線堤身，不能未經驗證共用同一穩定判據。~Three-dimensional flow around a breakwater head differs from a straight trunk, so their stability criteria are not automatically interchangeable. || 將堤身與堤頭測試資料分開比較。~Compare trunk and head test evidence as separate cases.
層間細料遷移可改變連通孔隙而不顯著改變總孔隙率，需看內部壓力反應。~Migration between layers can change connected voids without much change in total porosity, requiring attention to internal pressure response. || 對照流量與壓差檢查內部通道。~Compare measured flow and pressure difference for internal pathways.
斜面護面面積與水平投影面積不同，材料覆蓋密度的分母需跟著定義。~Armoured slope area differs from its horizontal projection, and the denominator used for coverage density must follow that definition. || 獨立計算水平投影與實際坡面面積。~Compute projected and actual slope areas independently.
土工織物還涉及接縫與穿刺，不能套用顆粒反濾的尺寸比便宣告等效。~Geotextiles introduce seam and puncture behavior and cannot be declared equivalent merely by applying a granular-filter size ratio. || 分別標示顆粒層與織物介面缺陷。~Map granular-layer and geotextile-interface defects separately.
以立方體代表尺寸保留體積而不保留所有投影面，受力仍需實際幾何。~The equivalent cube preserves volume without preserving every projected face, so load assessment still requires the actual exposed geometry. || 核對最長與最短主軸的比值。~Check the ratio of longest to shortest principal dimensions.
流向反轉會改變有效投影與接觸受力，波浪往復作用不能等同單向定常流。~Flow reversal changes exposed projection and contact loading, so oscillatory waves cannot be represented as one steady unidirectional current. || 對兩個主要流向分別畫投影面。~Draw projected areas separately for both principal flow directions.
沉陷還可能改變有效堤頂出水高，進而影響原先估計的越波和堤後排水需求。~Settlement can also reduce effective crest freeboard, altering the overtopping and rear-drainage demand originally estimated for the completed structure. || 把沉陷量換算成有效出水高變化。~Translate settlement into the corresponding effective-freeboard change.
此處張力是索的軸向力，不能把垂直分量誤當成吊索本身所承受的力。~Sling tension is axial force; its vertical component must not be mistaken for the force carried by the sling itself. || 以兩索分力總和重新核對平衡。~Recheck equilibrium using the sum of both sling components.
同一損傷數的風險仍受位置控制，堤頭或過渡區不能以堤身平均表現代替。~The significance of a damage number still depends on location; head or transition damage cannot be replaced by average trunk performance. || 將坡腳及轉折區另列損傷圖層。~Map toe and transition damage as separate survey layers.
''')
add('b283',r'''
水下材料重量與浮運排水重量屬不同控制體，列式時必須保持同一受力邊界。~Submerged material weight and whole-body floating displacement use different control volumes, requiring a consistent force boundary when assembling equilibrium. || 將重量表各分項回連到量測證據。~Link each weight-schedule entry to its measurement evidence.
乾舷還須按可能先進水的開口高程判斷，外牆最高點不是唯一相關高度。~Freeboard also depends on openings that can admit water first; the highest exterior wall point is not the only relevant elevation. || 另記最低非密閉開口的高程。~Record the lowest unsealed opening elevation independently.
初穩性公式的排水體積必須對應當下吃水，改變配重後不能只更新重心。~The displacement volume in initial stability must match current draft; after ballasting, updating gravity center alone is not sufficient. || 再以排水質量驗算當下浮力平衡。~Recheck current buoyancy against the displacement mass.
修正也取決於艙液與外水的密度比，不同液體時不能直接省略該係數。~The correction also depends on the density ratio between tank liquid and surrounding water, which cannot be omitted for different liquids. || 明列艙水與外水的密度比。~State the tank-liquid to surrounding-water density ratio explicitly.
吃水增量與波浪造成的瞬時角點運動不同，量測比較應採對應的時間平均。~Draft increment differs from instantaneous corner motion caused by waves, so measurement comparisons require a matching averaging period and definition. || 檢查吃水量測的時間平均窗口。~Check the averaging window used for draft observations.
底壓作用點還決定傾覆力矩，相同揚壓總量不代表相同底面接觸狀態。~The uplift application point also determines moment, so equal total uplift does not imply an identical foundation contact-pressure distribution. || 另外積分壓力對底面中心的力矩。~Integrate the pressure moment about the base center separately.
水平與垂直動載若不同相位，摩擦餘裕的最小時刻不一定是最大水平力時刻。~With phase differences between horizontal and vertical dynamics, the minimum friction margin need not occur at the peak horizontal force. || 檢查同時刻的水平力與底面揚壓。~Check horizontal load and uplift at matching times.
這個壓力圖只處理接觸分布，不包含基床材料強度或循環退化的判定。~This pressure diagram addresses contact distribution only; it does not establish bedding-material strength or resistance to deterioration under cyclic loading. || 以壓力圖積分核對合力作用位置。~Integrate the pressure diagram to verify the resultant location.
多點資料還能辨識局部支承沉陷，兩端連線以外的殘差不應直接當量測噪音。~Additional points can reveal localized support movement; residuals away from the endpoint line should not automatically be dismissed as measurement noise. || 檢查中間測點相對剛體線的殘差。~Check intermediate observations against the rigid-body line residuals.
靜水三角形的作用點位於各水深底部以上三分之一，兩側力矩仍須分開計算。~Each hydrostatic triangle acts one-third of its depth above the base, requiring separate moment calculation before subtracting the two sides. || 分別計算兩側水壓對底部的力矩。~Calculate each side's pressure moment about the base separately.
''')
add('b284',r'''
質量驗證也應保留水下有效重的定義，浸水可達孔隙會影響排水體積。~Mass checks must retain the submerged-weight definition because water-accessible voids can affect the displaced volume used for buoyancy calculation. || 另列缺角位置相對主要接觸臂的位置。~Locate missing corners relative to the primary contact arms.
膠材不一定只有水泥，計算分母需要遵循核准配比中對膠材的明確定義。~Binder need not consist only of cement; the calculation denominator must follow the explicit binder definition in the approved mixture. || 確認加水與骨材試驗的時間相符。~Confirm matching times for water addition and aggregate testing.
膨脹係數也可能因骨材而異，模型固定係數不等於所有混凝土都具有相同熱行為。~Thermal expansion depends on aggregate as well, so a fixed coefficient in the example does not imply identical behavior for every concrete. || 用另一組長度或溫差檢查線性換算。~Check the linear conversion using another length or temperature interval.
抗拉能力也隨齡期改變，應力和抗力需在相同時間比較才有物理意義。~Tensile resistance changes with age too; comparing stress and resistance at the same time is necessary for a physically meaningful interpretation. || 對照開裂時間與材料齡期的強度資料。~Compare cracking time with age-matched material strength evidence.
試體平均值與特徵值的統計意義不同，樣本數及離散程度需另外明列。~A specimen mean and a characteristic value have different statistical meanings, requiring separate statements of sample size and observed variability. || 再檢查試體與構件的養護溫度差異。~Check curing-temperature differences between specimens and full units.
吊點局部作用還取決於嵌件與混凝土的傳力，單一索力不能證明錨定合格。~Local attachment behavior depends on force transfer through inserts and concrete; one sling-force result cannot establish adequate anchorage performance. || 將吊點能力的證據與索力分開歸檔。~File attachment-capacity evidence separately from calculated sling forces.
實際斜面和水平面積的選擇會改變名義件數密度，跨專案比較要先統一定義。~Choosing actual slope area versus horizontal projection changes nominal placement density, so comparisons across projects require a consistent denominator first. || 分別檢查坡腳和坡頂的局部覆蓋。~Check local coverage at toe and crest separately.
位置距離是三維向量的長度，不會保留偏移方向，方向仍需另行記錄。~Position distance is the magnitude of a three-dimensional vector and does not preserve direction, which must therefore remain separately recorded. || 同時保存三個方向的原始偏差值。~Preserve the original offsets in all three directions.
模型接觸面若相對粗糙過大，摩擦行為可能與原型不同，即使質量縮尺正確。~Excessive relative roughness at model contacts can alter friction even when the mass scaling is correct for the chosen geometry. || 檢查模型接觸面的粗糙與摩擦假設。~Check assumptions for model contact roughness and friction.
耐久判讀還需要考慮鹽害與濕乾循環，機械磨耗不是唯一材料退化途徑。~Durability interpretation must also consider salt exposure and wet-dry cycling, because mechanical abrasion is not the sole material deterioration mechanism. || 確認兩次秤重使用相同乾燥基準。~Confirm identical drying reference conditions for both weighings.
''')
